    "## Creating a Retriever from a Vector Store\n",
    "\n",
    "In the next steps, we'll use the course documents we created to build a simple retriever. We'll embed the documents, store them in a vector database, and set up a retriever that can return the most relevant courses for a given query using embeddings (not a language model). Since our course descriptions are short, we don't need to split the text further. For more details, see the [LangChain Vectorstore Retriever documentation](https://python.langchain.com/docs/how_to/vectorstore_retriever/)."
   ]
