    "## Pairing the Retriever with a Large Language Model\n",
    "In this section, we’ll build a simple Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) bot using LangGraph. The bot will take a user question, retrieve relevant documents using the retriever we previously set up, and then use a large language model to generate a response based on that context.\n",
    "\n",
    "This setup enables us to ask course-related questions and receive informed answers grounded in the retrieved documentation."
   ]
